== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that looks like {{E|Loki}} and follows Isaac, firing tears in all four cardinal directions that deal 3.5 damage.
** {{dlc|nr}} Lil Loki shoots once per second.
** {{dlc|r}} Lil Loki shoots once every 3/4ths of a second.
* {{dlc|r}} {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Lokii}}.{{dlc-}}
* If an enemy is standing inside of Lil Loki, all four shots will hit it for a total of 14 damage.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Lil Loki having {{dlc|nr+}} 5th / {{dlc|r+}} 7th priority.

